# Review routing. Anyone with write access can open a pull request; this
# makes sure the maintainer is asked to look at it before it lands.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owners listed here automatically. It
# does not *require* one — that is a branch-protection setting ("Require
# a pull request before merging" → "Require approvals"). With more than
# one person able to push, turning it on is worth it.

